### ========================================
### PRUEBAS DE PERFIL DE USUARIO
### Nuevas funcionalidades implementadas
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Obtener perfil del usuario actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### CAMBIO DE CONTRASEÑA
### ========================================

### 2. Cambiar contraseña (exitoso)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "newSecurePassword456",
  "confirmPassword": "newSecurePassword456"
}

### 3. Cambiar contraseña (error - contraseña actual incorrecta)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "wrongPassword",
  "newPassword": "newSecurePassword456",
  "confirmPassword": "newSecurePassword456"
}

### 4. Cambiar contraseña (error - contraseñas no coinciden)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "newSecurePassword456",
  "confirmPassword": "differentPassword789"
}

### 5. Cambiar contraseña (error - nueva contraseña muy corta)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "short",
  "confirmPassword": "short"
}

### 6. Cambiar contraseña (error - nueva contraseña igual a la actual)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123"
}

### ========================================
### IMAGEN DE PERFIL
### ========================================

### 7. Actualizar imagen de perfil (exitoso)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileImageUrl": "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=12"
}

### 8. Actualizar imagen de perfil con otra URL
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileImageUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12345?v=4"
}

### 9. Eliminar imagen de perfil (establecer a null)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileImageUrl": null
}

### 10. Actualizar imagen de perfil (cadena vacía)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileImageUrl": ""
}

### ========================================
### ACTUALIZACIÓN DE PERFIL (Existente)
### ========================================

### 11. Actualizar datos de perfil (nombre, teléfono, bio, etc.)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez García",
  "phone": "+34123456789",
  "bio": "Desarrollador full-stack apasionado por la educación y la tecnología.",
  "preferredLanguage": "es"
}

### ========================================
### CREACIÓN DE USUARIO (Admin)
### Esto disparará el envío de correo de bienvenida
### ========================================

### 12. Crear nuevo usuario (envía correo de bienvenida)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevo.usuario@example.com",
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "González",
  "role": "student",
  "status": "active",
  "preferredLanguage": "es"
}

### 13. Crear usuario con contraseña personalizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "profesor.nuevo@example.com",
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Martínez",
  "role": "teacher",
  "password": "MiPassword123",
  "status": "active",
  "preferredLanguage": "es"
}

### ========================================
### VERIFICAR LOGS DE CORREO (Modo Mock)
### ========================================
### En modo desarrollo sin SMTP configurado, 
### los correos aparecerán en los logs del backend:
###
### [INFO] [MOCK EMAIL] To: nuevo.usuario@example.com | 
###       Subject: Bienvenido a la Plataforma de Evaluación | 
###       Password: abc12345
###
### Para envío real, configura SMTP en .env:
### Ver docs/EMAIL_CONFIGURATION.md
### ========================================
